# Supabase powers live multi-phone rooms at /play (Imposter + Sketch).
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com/dashboard
# 2. SQL Editor → paste supabase/parlor.sql → Run
# 3. Authentication → Sign In / Providers → turn on "Allow anonymous sign-ins"
# 4. Project Settings → Data API (URL) and API Keys (publishable key; the legacy anon key also works).
#    Paste both here and in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Leave the YOUR_ placeholders as-is to use same-device (multi-tab) mode.

PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=YOUR_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
